<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Onobasulu</book>
  <para style="h">Filibai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Folohe Filibai Sesefea Sowi Agele Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filibai</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="mt">Filibai</para>
  <para style="mt2">Folohe Filibai Sesefea</para>
  <para style="mt2">Sowi Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Folo e awalu sulu nafulu selabia siba labeofia, salu hano galulu segefia, Yulobo goafia, ehe Filibai sidi amida awalu sulu nafulu waleyo daalu. Filibai sidi amo, hele bule Masedonia ami dobu. (Hilibaisi Daalu 16.8-15 ami bamale.) Dufia, Folo auba selabia siba adesi, inolo noolohe ene sulu dubiyo habosia, e dibolo dafogolu. Aufia, e dibolo ami ligia, sowi ewe Filibai sesefea seleba melu. E dibolo ami dafogofia ligia, higinilu dulu. Auluso, ninihe sowi ewe alegasiamo, ene libo higinifia ligia seleluba bosoluale. Aubale. Folohe Yesufea asigi ule ufulu alolune, e henefiasu labi bosolu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dibolo ami ligia, Folo e dobelesiamo, inolo noolohe Filibai sese idele inolone asigi ule ufulumo, dabagalaba ufiyo weiyaafeba solumo dubulu. Inolo ili ogo nafuluba bamaleba, Folohe Filibai sese ilifea haguguba solu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Saminimo, Folo e mole kegele abobolu koleba alolu. Ausi, Filibai ilihe e sagoba ofelesia, mole efea mebailu. Aulune, sowi ewe selesiamo, Filibai ili efea mololu amone, Folohe ilifea henelu sulu selefe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aufia, nomo ewe, Folohe Filibi sigidubulu idele inolo asigi ule ufulumo kiwigaaba ufiyo hamefe. Ilihe Folo dibolo labeba hilisesia, wobasubale keleba hiliselosifia aulu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Folohe ulu kegele Godehe ilifea melu amone solu. Ulu kegele amo, miliyolu miliyo hili Yesu Kelisofea alefasia dulu. Folo selesia, Yudane sulu muguli kuliba daalu amofea alefasia, gilihe ulu kegele ewe dulualeba solu. Aubale. Yesu Kelisofea asigi ule ufulu amofea alefasiasu, amo dulu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aufia, Folohe Filibai ilimo, Kelisone mana dimesi hamelu. Keliso E Ene wi digiyone isaluale. Aubale. E ene meleba helea alefasia, dabalu Godehe Efea melumo mololu. Folohe eweguba selefe, idele inolo Kelisodai kulifia labemo, ili koleba Godene aealo difasia, henefiasu ado. Nini sowi ewe alegasiamo, nini hilisesia, Folohe Filibai sese idele inolomo bule koleba hameselububa bosolu.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:12-40">HD 16.12-40</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folodai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodidai</char>, animo, <char style="w">Keliso</char> Yesune <char style="w">balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe</char> lolu. Anihe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PHP 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">Sowi ewe, Filibai sese amone sigidubulu idele inoloda, amone guni inoloda, amone digono inoloda, gili suniafea seleba mesu. Gili Keliso Yesufea kulilu ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godedai muuba kalilu alolu idele inolo</char> alebaibu.<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Nine Nao Godedai, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu Kelisodaihe, gilifea kanuluba ofelesia, gine asigine libo esebalo gadaeaba melesi moloyobafe.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Godefea henelu sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Hilia sunia, nahe gili hilisesia, na ne Godefea henelu sulu selaba ado. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Nahe, gili sunia sagoba ofelesia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selaba</char> ligiamo, hilia sunia na henebasu ligia, Godedai sulu selabasu ado. <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />Na gilifea heneba ado amone maumo, ewe. Hilia gilida asigi ule maugaba ufuluiya amifia inigia, aga iwida, gilimo ninidai dafifia alebaiso. Seale, Godene awalu sulu nafulu waleyo dabalu molofea ami, nini ua dafifia lolu. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:8">1Kld 1.8</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, nahe ewe sealeba hilisesu. Dabalu nafulu koleba, gilifea maugabu ogo, Ehe dabalu ewe mololabia abia, Keliso Yesune hilia adesi, moloba samodoyobafe.<verse eid="PHP 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Nahe gili hiliseba ligiamo, asigi nafulu amogulu hiliselumo, amo isolu. Maumo, gili ne yagu labe. Na dibolo labinagada, me, na awalu sulu nafulu amone kiwigaaba sagoba ofolaba labinagada, hama, gili suniahe, na galiba Godene <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululomo</char> ua osolaba dulu.<verse eid="PHP 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Keliso Yesu Ene yagunagalo amo alefasia, na gili sunia bule koleba babaiyeba hamefe. Godehe na seale auba molofeba saeyodolu labe.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Hilia sunia, na Godedai sulu eweguba sodo. Gili dawalolo diaba ligia, kegele sunia fadaba eloba babiyone, gine hameselo bule koleba soboba melesifia, haaliba ado. <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10-11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:23">1Des 5.23</ref></char></note>Gine hameselo auba soboba labi, gilihe kegele olaibomo amene dobulaba, osolaba babiyodolu miliyobafe. Aufia, sebe isolu Yesufea helebumo gilifea wasigafia labi, gili galagololu koleba melesifia, na Godedai sulu selaba ado. Aufia, gili kegele uleno heleba daaluda male adabia abia, Kelisone hilia adesi, elomesifia, na Godedai sulu amoda selabasu ado. Ausi, idele inolohe gili auba labi bisigia, ilihe wi bule Godefea mesia, Ene wi digiyobafe.<verse eid="PHP 1:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo e dibolo dofaba ufuluso, awalu sulu nafulu saeyomo kaaluale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, aga gili eweguba asigimesi hamefe. Kegele nafea mololu ewemo, awalu sulu nafulumo kaabuale. Aubale. Amohe awalu sulu nafulumo kiwigaaba ofelefe. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:30">HD 28.30</ref></char></note>Enebamo, yobolo inolo Sisane molo iwi yasiba ado ili suniada, inolo noolo suniada, ili aga fadaba hilisesia, na Kelisone dabalu moloba lolu ewene, dibolo dofafia loluba hilisefe. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Aufia, na dofalu labe ewefea alefasia, sigidubulu damene wedinalehe, Saminilofea kiwigaasi, ine sagililomo dedaleba yaalu. Ausi, ilihe Godene sulu manamo kiwigaaba koleba selaba labe. <figure style="fig" alt="Paul in chains" file="55_2Ti_04_04_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="1.12-14">Folo e seini dofafia dibolo labe.</figure><verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Seale, Godene sulu manada walefe ilimo, mosomu aida labe. Inolo noolo ilihe, wi bule na duluguba dibaiyesia, waseba, waseba, Kelisone sulu mana walefe. Auluso, noolomo asigi nafulu ufia ligia, Kelisone sulu mana walefe. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Inolo ili ewemo, hameselo alefasia aufe. Enebamo, ili hilisefemo, Godehe na iminilumo, awalu sulu nafulu amone haguguba kiwigaaba saamesi, gadefalububa hilisefe. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Auluso, ili noolo ogomo, asigume adesia, ine wi bule digibaiyesia, asigi isoluale ufia ligia, Kelisone awalu sulu nafulumo walefe. Auba molofemo alefasia, ilihe na dibolo labimo, higinilu noolo nafea gegoaba ufiyone weiyaafe. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Auluso, asigi nafulu ofasia walesenagada, me asigi wolu ofasia walesenagada, waagima. Enebamo, olaibo kegelemo, ewe. Ilihe Kelisone sulu mana walefe. Aufene, na henesu. Ee, na henelabia daabasu miliyo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="PHP 1:18">Folohe Filibai sagoba ufiyone, aso bebea miliyo hamefe</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:18">Seale, na henelabia daabasu miliyo. <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:11">2Kld 1.11</ref></char></note>Enebamo, na eweguba hilisefia lolu. Gilihe <char style="w">Godedai sulu selefe</char> ogoda, Yesu Kelisone Asubane sagoba ofelefe amodai alefasia, na sububa dafogoyobafe. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Aulugulu, na kiwigaaba moloba ligia, yuaba miliyaleba yasifia <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofelagofia</char> lolu. Ausi, na isoba kiwigaasi, na hilia sunia moloba adoguba, na aso bebea ligianagada, me na olasenagada, mana na moloba alolumohe Kelisone wi digiyobafe.<verse eid="PHP 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 2:20">Gal 2.20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nafealomo, na helefealu iwi bebea lolu ewene mau modomo, Keliso E labe. Aufia, na olasimo, kegele nafulune nafulu nafea holobagaeyobafe. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Na aso domaladai aselabia daaba labi, na sebe nafulu heleyone dabalu moloyobasu. Auluso, na kegele halane molobebeleyobi? Na babeafe.<verse eid="PHP 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 5:8">2Kld 5.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kegele aida amohe na sigife. Agelemo, na aga solu ewe afasia, Kelisodai miliyone dabaiyeba hamefe. Auba adesi, nafulune nafulu miliyobafe. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Auluso, aganebomo, na aso bebea aselabia aasenaga, amo gilifealomo nafulu koleba miliyobafe. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Na seale auba hilisebune, na hilisesia, na aso misiyo. Aufia, gine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char> heneba sobomesine, na gili suniadai aselabia maiyobasu.<verse eid="PHP 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Ausi, na gili labea obegeba inigia, gilidai saabia no ua adesimo, dabalu na mololumo alefasia, gili Yesu Kelisofea kulilu ligia, Efea kaiisia heneyobafe.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:1">Efe 4.1</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 2:12">1Des 2.12</ref></char>
    </note>Aga kegele bulemo, gine miliyolu ogo, Kelisone awalu sulu nafulu selefeguba, kuliba daaba melale. Ausi, na gili babiyo esenagada, me gili molofe ogo sulu balu dobelesenagada, na hilisesia, gili hilise ule alefasia, ua kalugaabuba hilisefia lolu. Aufia, gilihe awalu sulu nafulufea asigi ule ufulu amone hagugusia, belagufeba hilisefia lolu. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Gine gisa baaba sagilimabiyo. Ausi, ilifea eloba babiyobafemo, ewe. Ili woba dafelesi, gili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> diyobafe. Godehe auba moloyobafe.<verse eid="PHP 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:19-40">HD 16.19-40</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Enebamo, Keliso mololumo alefasia, gilifea ulu kegele melu. Kelisofea <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> melesi iminilu amo, Godehe gilifea ulu kegele melu dobu. Auluso, amosuale. Maumo, Efea alefasia naga namenesi, amoda gilifea ulu melu dobu. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Saminimo, gilihe na belagusi abulu. Aga, na aso belaguba labeba selesi, gili dobelefe. Aulugulu, belagufe ule hamagane, gilida, nadai ua ligia, belagufe.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Nini ua hilise ule ufia ligia, noolofea nafulu moloyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Gili gine miliyolu Kelisofea kulifia labe ogohe, gili kiwigaafela? Ene hameselo amohe, gine libo aeaba waalefela? Ausi, gilimo <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubanedai</char> ule adefela? Gili gine geleba damene ligia, gine gelebamo yagunagalo mana walelola? Ee, gili auba molofemone, nafea heneba ofelefe. <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />Ausi, ne henelomo eweguba wasigaaba homale. Gine geleba asigi imini ule ofelesia, hameselu ule aiba adesia, gili ua hilise ule melale. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:26">Gal 5.26</ref></char></note>Gine geleba asigume adesia, wi digibaiyesia, kegele ulenoda molomabiyo. Auluso, gili helea adesia, noolo anogone wihe, gine wimo suniamesi hilisemale. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:24">1Kld 10.24</ref></char></note>Gili elebi elebibahe, gine hame moloyo ogosu bamabiyo. Aubale. Noolo anogone hame amoda bamale.<verse eid="PHP 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-s</para>
  <para style="s">Keliso Ene meleba helea adesi, Godehe Ene wi digilu</para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Gine asigi Keliso Yesune asigi hamagulu homale.<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:1-2">Yon 1.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17:5">17.5</ref></char>
    </note>E seale Gode waaga alolu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 2:6">Auluso, E Gode waagulu miliyone asigi amo hiliseluale.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 8:9">2Kld 8.9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:14">Yon 1.14</ref></char>
    </note>E asigi amo afasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 2:7">
    <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu moloba ofolo</char> amogulu adesia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 2:7">E inolole waaga seba dulu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 2:7">Ausi, inolo ilihe E-mo inolole inolo labi abulu.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 5:8">Hib 5.8</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:2">12.2</ref></char>
    </note>Auba ligia, E ene meleba helea adesia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 2:8">Godene sulu seale koleba kuliba abia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 2:8">E olalu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 2:8">Seale, sulu auba kuliba abia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 2:8">E <char style="w">imolane</char> olalu.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:33">HD 2.33</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:20-21">Efe 1.20-21</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:3-4">Hib 1.3-4</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, Godehe E fogo anane ana koleba ofasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 2:9">Efea wi suniada wasolu amone wi melu.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 14:11">Lom 14.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w">Hebene</char> lagida,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 2:10">helefealu iwida,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 2:10">helefealu sisa iligida,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 2:10">ili sunia Yesune wi dobelesia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 2:10">E wabialesia, Efea emo hugulumo sagamesi aulu.<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 10:9">Lom 10.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausia, mofeyo suniahe</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 2:11">Yesu <char style="w">Keliso</char> E-mo <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminiloba</char> fogaba saamesi aulu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 2:11">Ausi, ilihe Enao Godene wi wabialelo <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elalelumo</char> digiyobafe.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="rem">z1col-e</para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo ili aleba ami, ninimo yanegulu melale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Aulugulu, ne yagusodali, na gilidai ugi ua aloiya ami, gilihe Godene sulu kuliba daalu amomo, olaibo kegele. Aga na gilidai male labida, gili aubasu moloba adesimo, amo olaibo wasolu kegele. Gili koleba, aubasu sagilifia, bibiliba ligia, Godene sulu kuliba malale. Gili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> dulu amone dabalumo kiwigaafia, samodobaiyeba mololabia dedalemale. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Maumo, Godehe gine libo usu ugi dabalu molobasu ado. Gili mana E hamefeguba molomesine, Ene Ehe gine asigimo degeba ofolaba ado. Aufia, Ehe gili dabalu amo molomesine, kiwigagaluda mebasu ado.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Kegele sunia molosiamo, gogomobale, hegeba sulu saabale molomale. <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:5">Lo 32.5</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:3">Dan 12.3</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 1:10">Fil 1.10</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 2:19">1Des 2.19</ref></char></note>Ausimo, gili heleba daaluda male ligia, Godene faibili isolu galagololu kakainaeyobafe. Gili helefealu iwi, <char style="qt">mosomu koagelu wolu mololo ili aleba yoba sigia</char>, gilimo, sigabi anakiwifea neeba yaafeguba, ilifea auba neeba yaafia alebaibu. <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />Enebamo, gilihe sulu miliyoludamo fedoba sefia alebaibune, aufe. Gili sulu amo auba sesalifia labi, Kelisone hilia adefeiyamo, na gilifea kaiisia heneyobasu. Fogo ami, hogololu dabalu sunia na mololu amone weaselualeba hilisesia, heneyobasu.<verse eid="PHP 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Gine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> ogomo, ulu kegele Godefea soba melugulu labe. Aufia, na hilisesia, ilihe na dufa olasia, ne ibimo waini ulu meloguba sagasia, gili ulu mefe ogodaiba sobelesenagada, hama, na henefiasu ligia, gilidai ua heneyobasu. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:1">Fil 3.1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:4">4.4</ref></char></note>Aubasu, gilida henefiasu ligia, nadai ua koleba henemale.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Dimodimo Filibai sidi ami malaleyoba hilisefe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Saminilo Yesu auba hamesenaga, nahe <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodi</char> gili labea alebale malalebaiyeba <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasisu</char>. Aufia, e haiba na labea obegesiamo, gili auba labeoba nafea awasimo, ne libo heneyobasu.<verse eid="PHP 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Inolo noolo na galiba labe ewemo, Dimodigulu male. E nadai hilise ule ufia ligia, ehe gili sagoba ufiyo amone eno isasia hiliseba ado. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:10">2Dim 4.10</ref></char></note>Ili noolo suniahe, ine kegele amosu keleba hilisesiaso, Yesu Kelisone kegele hiliselale. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Auluso, Dimodine mana nafulumo gili asigibu. Maumo, faibehe enao sagoba ofologuba, e nadai awalu sulu nafulune dabalu ua mololu amo, gili asigibu. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Aulugulu, na e-mo gili labea malaleyoso, dibolo yasilo inolo ilihe nafea kegele amene koleba molofelaba babiyone, na amodale yasiba lolu. Amo bafasia, na e gili labea alebale malaleyo. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Aufia, na asigi ule ofasia, Saminilofea kiwigaafia ligia, nene nada gili labea galibale miyobasuba hilisesu.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Efafodisumo Filibai ami obegeba malalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 4:18">Fil 4.18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, na hilisesia, Efafodisu e-mo, aga gili labea haiba obegeba malaleyoba hilisesu. Samini, gilihe e na sagoba homesi na labea hilibailu. Aufia, e ne nelewo adesia, ani dabalu ua molosia, ua yoboba alolu. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Aga e hilisesia, gilihe e walefa dobuba solu amo dubulububa hilisefe. Aulugulu, e ene libo higinisia, gili sunia babaiyeba hilisefe.<verse eid="PHP 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Seale koleba, e walefasia, olaeyo weiyaaso. Auluso, Godehe efea <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanuluba</char> ofeleso. Efeasuale, nafeada kanuluba ofeleso. Enebamo, yagunagalo hilimo, yagunagalo na ama dulu amofea, waagi gegoamesialesia, Godehe nafea kanuluba ofelesia, e waiba ofeleso. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Ausi, gilihe e obegeba saabe bisigia henemesi, nahe e gili labea hilibaiyo koleba hamefe. Ausi, ne libo higinilu amoda asigileyobafe. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Saminilofea alefasia, gili koleba, e-mo heneba luba dimale. E-gulu alebaibu ine wimo, wabialesia digimale. <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />Mau enebamo, e Kelisone dabalu molosia, olaeyo hagoale adeso. E ene miliyolu weaseyomo sagilisale. Aubale. Gilihe na sagoba homesisia, efea dabaluiya gadefalu amone, e hilisebasu adeso.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Inolo Kelisofea asigi ule ufulu labe amo, e isolu galagololu labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, doma. Na sulu noda gegoasiamo, gilifea eweguba selesu. <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilofea</char> henefia melale. Sulu ule hamagane, na gilifea saabia no seleba meyomo, na kolelu bosoluale. Ewemo, gili nafulu kakainamesi haguguba selesu. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Wolu moloba yaalo geso ogo, gilihe nafuluba bamale. Bado wobasubale geleba dafalilo, ili ogo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amo eweguba besabe, fogo ami, inolo noolohe, idele inolofea selesia, ili keliso adesia, Isolaelene mana kulisiamo, inolone momada bado amaleba geleba yaamaleba sodo. Folohe inolo ili amone sulumo hameluale. Ausi, ehe Filibai ili ogo nafuluba bamesifia haguguba solu.</char></note> <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:29">Lom 2.29</ref></char></note> Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba geleyo</char> mana amone maumo, ili nafuluba asigiba duluale. Aubale. Godene Asubaneda alefasia gulugululo mosomu ninimo, bado amaleba gelelu mosomu seale lolu. Domalane kegele amohe, nini sagoba ofolaleba hilisesia, Keliso Yesu Efeasu alefasia, nini kaiiba saeyodolu lolu. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:3">HD 22.3</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 11:18">2Kld 11.18</ref></char></note>Auluso, domalane kegele amohe, nini sagoba ofelesiabiaga, amo na koleba nafulu alebaiyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 3:4">Enebamo, ne domalafealomo alefasia, kaiiba saeyone mau wedinale, na dobu. Amone, na ili noolo wasolu lolu. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:59">Lug 1.59</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 11:22">2Kld 11.22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 23:6">HD 23.6</ref></char></note>Mau amo ewe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PHP 3:5" />
  <para style="li1" vid="PHP 3:5">Na seba dulu hilia aaiyo adesimo, na bado amaleba gelelu</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="PHP 3:5">Aufia, na Benisamenene mosomu inolo lolu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="PHP 3:5">Mosomu ami seba dulumo alefasia, na seale <char style="w">Isolaele</char> inolo lolu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="PHP 3:5">Aufia, na <char style="w" lemma="Hibulu">Hibulule</char> Hibulu inolo koleba lolu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="PHP 3:5">Aufia, <char style="w">muguli</char> kuliba anofealomo, na <char style="w">Falisi</char> alolu.<verse eid="PHP 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">HD 8.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, na molobaiyeba hiliselofealomo, hogololu dabalu molosia <char style="w" lemma="Sese">sesefea</char> naga melu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="PHP 3:6">Aufia, inolohe muguli mana kuliba aasi isolu adofealo amone, na heleba daaluda male alolu.<verse eid="PHP 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:44-46">Mad 13.44-46</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kegele sunia amomo, samini na ne huliane kegele ufulububa abulu. Auluso, aga na <char style="w">Keliso</char> kuliba aasu ewe alefasia, kegele amomo hodobaiyo kegele bosolu. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Kegele lagi na solu amosuale. Aubale. Na hilisesiamo, kegele suniamo hodobaiyo kegele dobuba hilisefe. Maumo, nahe ne Saminilo Keliso Yesu asigife amohe, kegele sunia wasefasia, nafulune nafulu koleba adefe. Ausi, Efea alefasia, nahe kegele sunia afalifasia, wolu kegele saidafologuba, saidafalilu. Auba mololu maumo, Keliso E-mo, seale ne huliane kegele melesi mololu.<verse eid="PHP 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 3:21-22">Lom 3.21-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, na Edai koleba kulifia miliyo hamefe. Na muguli mana sigiba dobaiyeba hilisefe ewemo, nene meleba koleba isolu galagololu miliyodoluale bosolu. Aga na Kelisofea <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> dobu ewe alefasia, na isolu galagololu mana amo sebu. Isolu galagololu mana amomo, asigi ule ofelesi Godefeafia ano. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:3-5">Lom 6.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:17">8.17</ref></char></note>Na Keliso E koleba asigibaiyeba hamefe. Aufia, E olafia <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degelu</char> amone kiwigagalu bule amoda, na koleba asigiba dibaiyeba hamefe. Aufia, E naga dulu amoda, ani ua osolaba dibaiyeba hamefe. Aufia, E olasia asigi hiliseluguba, nada aubasu asigibaiyeba hamefe. <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />Aufia, na hilisesia, nada olasimo, haiba degefia dabaiyeba hilisefe.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe elebe dibaiyesia, imini ufuluiya ami goayone, kiwigaaba naguba ano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 6:12">1Dim 6.12</ref>, <ref loc="1TI 6:19">19</ref></char>
    </note>Na elebe difasia ligia, ama isoba samodolu loluba saaba dafogosuale. Auluso, Keliso Yesu Ehe elebe amo na dimesifia, E na diba dulu amone, dibaiyeba weiyaasu. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Auluso, ne nelewodali, nahe elebe amo ama dulu loluba hilisesuale. Auluso, kegele uleno na moloyo dobumo ewe, na faisalo dobumo afasia, na maiyofealo asogolo dobu amone gebaiyeba isaba weiyaasu. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:24">1Kld 9.24</ref></char></note>Elebe amo dimesi iminiba ufuluiya asogolo isoba naguba aasu. Elebe amomo ewe, ana lagone miliyolu miliyo, Godehe Keliso Yesufea alefasia, na amo dimesi welu.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 2:6">1Kld 2.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nini sunia asubanefealo asidalu labemo, asigi aubasu ufiyo dobu. Auluso, gilihe asigi no ofelesenaga, Godehe gilifea ulufaba moloba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Auluso, eno ule amo, ninihe asogolo kuliba dedaleba aloiya ami, agada, nini eno amo aibasu malale.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:16">1Kld 4.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, gili ne mimisililu adaaba yaeyone, na dedeba mololuguba molomale. Nini moloba walelumo kuliba dedalefe ili amone, nafuluba sidafiasu kuliba malale.<verse eid="PHP 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Samini, nahe gilifea sulu ewe fogo wedinale soluso, aga na saabia sulu hamagane bu egeba, si hanodaiba selesu. Wedinale ilimo, Kelisone <char style="w">imolane</char> amone gisagulu kakainabu. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:18">Lom 16.18</ref></char></note>Ine asigimo, helefealune kegele amosu kakaba ado. Ine domalane hamemo, ine godegulu ado. Ili yuaeyodolu kegele moloyone, henesia kaiiba ado. Ili goayo aafea amimo, woba dafiyo dobia ami aafe. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:6">Efe 2.6</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 2:19">19</ref></char></note>Auluso, ninimo, <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenene</char> idele inolo melesi iminiba dobu. Nini <char style="w">gasiba dafelagoba dilo</char> inolo Saminilo Yesu Keliso, hebene amifia suga milesi, yasisu. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:28">1Kld 15.28</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 15:42-53">42-53</ref></char></note>Ene kiwigagalu alefasia, Kelisohe kegele sunia E sisa melesi moloyodolu labe. Kiwigagalu amo alefasia, Ehe nine helefealune domala wabelalu ewe, dedegeba yaafasia, Ene <char style="w">elalelu</char> domalagulu moloba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s">Ninihe hilise ule ofasia, henesia asigi nafulu ufiyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 2:19-20">1Des 2.19-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, ne hameseludalimo, gili koleba labe. Gine misi na babaiyeba hameba lolu. Nada heneba ofolomo, gili koleba. Na moloba alolumone elebemo, gili. Aulune, ne yagusodali, gine miliyolumo, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilofea</char> kiwi kolefia, yoba alebaimale.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Ido aida, Yodiadai, Sidikedai, nahe aalifea kiwigaaba eweguba selesu. Aali Saminilofea alefasia, ginalodai adoguba hilise ule homale. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:20">Lug 10.20</ref></char></note>Aalu auba hilise ule homesi, nahe nadai ua dabalu mololo gafea eweguba doba bosolu, “Gahe ido aida amo sagoba homale.” Enebamo, samini aaluhe, awalu sulu nafulu waleyone, hogololu dabalu na galiba mololo. Aalusuale. Kelemeneda, inolo nooloda, nadai dabalu auba ua mololo. Idele inolo ili ewe suniane wimo, Miliyolu Miliyo Bugo ami selelu dobu.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Hilia sunia, gilihe Saminilofea henebasu melale. Na saabia selesu. Henebasu melale! <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:25">Hib 10.25</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:8-9">Yem 5.8-9</ref></char></note>Idele inolo suniahe gine onalo mana bamesi walemale. Saminilo hagoale labe. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mad 6.25-34</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:2">Kol 4.2</ref></char></note>Gilihe kegele uleno keleba hilisemabiyo. Auluso, hilia sunia gili <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selesiamo</char>, gili diyodolu amone haalisiamo, Efea, ge libo ogo wisoba henesia, haalimale. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:3">Ais 26.3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:27">Yon 14.27</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:15">Kol 3.15</ref></char></note>Ausi, Godene <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealo</char> amohe, Keliso Yesufea alefasia, gine liboda, gine asigida, haguguba yasifia miliyobafe. Godene aealo amohe, nini inolone asigi imini dobumo sunia sunialo.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, na gilifea sulu no gegoaba selesu. Doma.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PHP 4:8" />
  <para style="li1" vid="PHP 4:8">Kegele nafulu yogolelu dobu amo suniada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="PHP 4:8">Wi digiba saeyone mana amoda, gine asigifea wasigaaba yaamale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="PHP 4:8">Seale sulu sododa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="PHP 4:8">Fufuulu mana mololoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="PHP 4:8">Isolu mololoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="PHP 4:8">Galagololu mana mololoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="PHP 4:8">Hamedufulu mana amoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="PHP 4:8">Hedaba sodo mana amoda.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="PHP 4:8">Asigi amosu gine libofea wasigaaba yaamale.<verse eid="PHP 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:20">Lom 16.20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sulu na selesida, mana na molosida, gili baafia dawaloba dulu amo, dedeba molomale. Ausi, aealoda melo Gode E-mo, gilidai miliyobafe.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filibai ilihe Folofea kegele mebailu amone e henelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Aufia, gilihe aga yagi na sagoba ufiyone eno abulumone, na Saminilofea bule koleba henesu. Seale, samini, gilihe na sagoba ufiyone hiliseluso, fogo amimo gili eno male abulu. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Na sulu ewe selesumo, kegele uleno na abobosia, dibaiyesia selesuale. Aubale. Amene kegele nafea holobagafea ami dedeba besabi, amofea henefiasu, esebalo miliyo mana amone dawalolo, na dulu lolu.<verse eid="PHP 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Kegele diyodolu fogomo, na abulu. Aufia, kegele wedinale ufiyo fogo amoda, na abulu. Naiyo kubalefia ligianagada, me mamiafia ligianagada, kegele bule ufia ligianagada, me wedino kegele ufia ligianagada, henefiasu esebalo miliyo mana amone dedeba besabi, amofea na dawalolo dulu lolu. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 12:10">2Kld 12.10</ref></char></note>Godehe kiwigagalu nafea mefe amofea alefasia, na kegele sunia isoba moloyodolu lolu.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Auluso, na higinilu diba gaabi, gilihe nafea sagoba ufulu amo, nafulu koleba. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">2Kld 11.9</ref></char></note>Aufia, Filibai idele inolo gilimo, ewe hilisefia labe. Saminimo, nahe awalu sulu nafulu gili labea walefasia, hele bule <char style="w">Masedonia</char> afasia aasi, <char style="w">sese</char> ulenohe nadai ua sabe meyone mana molosia, nafea kegele ulenoda mesale. Aubale. Gilisu meso. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Na Desalonaika dauno ami ligia, kegele diyodoluba labimo, gilihe na sagoba ofelesia, kegele nafea mebaibasu adeso. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Nahe ulu kegele gilifea dibaiyefia labebuba hilisemabiyo. Aubale. Na hamefemo ewe. Gine samolo hebene lagi gegoafe amo, na babaiyeba lolu.<verse eid="PHP 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Kegele noolo gilihe Efafodisune sone saabia nafea mebaisi, dulu amo, gili nadai dano ufulumo sabe duguba samodolu. Sabe duguba meyo amone iminisu melualebiyo. Aubale. Gilihe amone imini waseba suniaba melubiyo. Kegele gili mebailu amo, kasineda nafulu soba melugulu dobu. Soba mefe amogulumo, Godehe amone kasine dobelesia henelo.<verse eid="PHP 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Kegele sunia gili diyodoluba hilisebumo, ne Godehe, Keliso Yesufea alefasia, Ene beleme <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elaleluda</char> ofola amifia, gilifea wasigaaba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="PHP 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Nini koleba,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 4:20">nine Nao Godene wi</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 4:20">digilabia daabasu miliyoba.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 4:20">
    <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">Elalelumo</char> Efea alefalu alefaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PHP 4:20">
    <char style="sls">
      <char style="w">Amen</char>.</char> Amo seale koleba.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Foloda ilihe Filibai idele inolofea hawiyoba selefe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Keliso Yesune muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> gili suniafea, na hawiyoba selesu. Nelewodali na galiba iwi alebaibu ilida, gilifea hawiyoba selefe. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Muuba kalilu idele inolo ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Sisa">Sisane</char> wabialelo yala usu ami dabalu mololo alebaibu ili suniada, gilifea hawiyoba selefe.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Saminilo Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululomo</char>, gine asubanefea miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 4:23">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="EndOfBookOnobasulu_Epistles.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="4.23" /><verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>